-- risk: additive
-- (the server's copies of the feature manifest and the setup level catalogue
-- learn one flag; no row moves)
--
-- 0646 (#2470) -- mtdSubmission, the flag of the HMRC MTD VAT submission:
-- platform tier, OFF, under vatDeclarations, offered at the tax level
-- "books" of the setup guide. A server gate calls
-- public.feature_effective(ws, 'mtdSubmission'); the connection table and
-- the edge function follow in the next slice and never run for a space that
-- has not switched it on.

-- ── the feature registry knows it (dart run tool/build_feature_registry_sql.dart) ──
